helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_form.xhp	0	help	par_id3150229	47			0	pl	Kliknij wybrany poziom indeksu na liście \<emph\>Poziomy\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_form.xhp	0	help	par_id3150934	48			0	pl	Kliknij wybrany styl na liście \<emph\>Style akapitów\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
