helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150964	51			0	pl	Wybierz \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120300.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Indexes and Tables - Bibliography Entry\"\>\<emph\>Wstaw - Indeksy i spisy - Wpis bibliograficzny\</emph\>\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
