helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068	6			0	pl	Kliknij ikonę \<emph\>Linia\</emph\> \<image id=\"img_id3144510\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formatline.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3144510\"\>Ikona\</alt\>\</image\>. Spowoduje to otwarcie okna dialogowego \<emph\>Format - Linia\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
