helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2012				0	pl	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Master Pages\</item\> deck lists currently used, recently used, and available master pages. Right-click a master page thumbnail for a sub-menu to apply or edit the master page. This deck is only available for presentations.				20130618 17:22:18
