helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\digitalsignatures.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	pl	The Signed icon\<image id=\"img_id4557023\" src=\"xmlsecurity/res/certificate_16.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1146in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id4557023\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> indicates a valid digital signature, while the Exclamation mark icon\<image id=\"img_id249336\" src=\"xmlsecurity/res/caution_11x16.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1146in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id249336\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> indicates an invalid digital signature.				20130618 17:22:18
